{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the World After the Battle of Red Cliffs</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/875f3ff909a471f9d33945bc3d274560.avif?t=1750350230\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by traditional <strong>Chinese Lianhuanhua (comic books)</strong> and <strong>90s Chinese textbooks</strong>, <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> brings hand-drawn characters to life, carefully crafted to capture the essence of Chinese artistry. Step into a <strong>2.5D Metroidvania world</strong> styled like a classic Chinese Lianhuanhua!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Gripping Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mysterious assassin, you set out to eliminate <strong>Cao Cao</strong> on the battlefield of <strong>Red Cliffs</strong>\u2014but why did you lose your memory? Travel across the land, uncover forgotten truths, and meet legendary heroes as you unveil a catastrophe that threatens the world. Will you and your allies be able to save the people from disaster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Vast and Beautiful World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>over ten unique locations</strong>, from peaceful villages to brutal warzones, from endless deserts to snow-covered forests. <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> showcases breathtaking landscapes inspired by China's diverse scenery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/4bda592f921a6530edab03189e8af347.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/4bda592f921a6530edab03189e8af347.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Hidden Treasures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through exploration and combat, <strong>collect rare treasures</strong> to grow stronger, unlocking <strong>previously inaccessible areas</strong>. Delve into the unknown, acquire powerful artifacts, and defeat formidable new enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/42dbf1347aef8b8afe71084f2dedc731.avif?t=1750350230\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras_big/42dbf1347aef8b8afe71084f2dedc731.avif?t=1750350230 width=800 height=370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Diverse Cast of Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>over 80 meticulously hand-drawn enemies</strong>, including formidable warriors, legendary beasts, and ruthless assassins. Each <strong>boss fight</strong> is uniquely designed, featuring beautifully animated enemy deaths\u2014proving that this world is full of surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle in the Air and on Horseback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is not limited to walking\u2014<strong>storm enemy camps on horseback</strong> or <strong>take to the skies</strong> for intense aerial combat! These unique gameplay segments are woven into the story, ensuring an ever-fresh experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/0be2f85bf2aa5a5ef0699c44bc0f6950.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/0be2f85bf2aa5a5ef0699c44bc0f6950.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/0be2f85bf2aa5a5ef0699c44bc0f6950.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Information</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Demo</strong> of <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> allows players to experience the <strong>comic book-style</strong> visuals and get a taste of this <strong>side-scrolling ARPG</strong> before its full release.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Save Function</strong> \u2013 This special prologue version does not support saving. However, players can replay the <strong>three available stages</strong> as many times as they like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language</strong> \u2013 To enhance historical immersion, the test version defaults to <strong>Traditional Clerical Script</strong> commonly used during the Three Kingdoms period.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Differences</strong> \u2013 The demo may differ from the final release.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an <strong>independent developer</strong>, I am committed to continuously refining the game. This is just the <strong>beginning, not the end</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the game, please <strong>add <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> to your wishlist</strong>\u2014your support means the world to me!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thank You for Your Support!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Our Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: <strong>1016824586</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u5200\u5149\u706b\u6d77","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1927100/cdb86485859308fab7b684c88677f4aee9a74e66.jpg"},{"name":"\u864e\u53e3\u8131\u9669","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1927100/7ad8e522655b89b046873ede0830244fd65594c2.jpg"},{"name":"\u8840\u67d3\u4e49\u9014","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1927100/130ac69d2e02877bd891409975fe4aeecd17b4bb.jpg"},{"name":"\u501f\u96f7\u4f0f\u5996","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1927100/f08c6b1f0096fe4db5b2dc6772c02e825065a0c3.jpg"},{"name":"\u4e49\u8d77\u676f\u4e2d","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1927100/804cf553604f2160b511f3b53a31e850ccc5ed50.jpg"},{"name":"\u9752\u9cde\u9057\u6068","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1927100/d7ec74f3e077068f540b3f54b792191a081748e3.jpg"},{"name":"\u9006\u7259\u5578\u4e49","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1927100/010f1e7993f0b9e5509ec9bab0e581d804fbdc50.jpg"},{"name":"\u9752\u53f2\u91cd\u4e66","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1927100/1c4233dd9c6cd828fad584f95d8cee42a6655af6.jpg"},{"name":"\u65a9\u864e\u7acb\u5a01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1927100/3bed560d8c742cd067249bb40b89cc0edab0a549.jpg"},{"name":"\u4e03\u96f6\u516b\u843d","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1927100/2ce7e5fa3ed526ceb96f40f83c4cc00fdf149c6d.jpg"}],"total":83},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1927100?t=1750350230","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750350230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/23158255a949e0664fe5f223e0482aa94955d629/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750350230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/23158255a949e0664fe5f223e0482aa94955d629/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750350230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"In order to show the cruelty of war, this game has cartoon amputation, bleeding, and other effects."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1948880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the World After the Battle of Red Cliffs</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/875f3ff909a471f9d33945bc3d274560.avif?t=1750350230\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by traditional <strong>Chinese Lianhuanhua (comic books)</strong> and <strong>90s Chinese textbooks</strong>, <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> brings hand-drawn characters to life, carefully crafted to capture the essence of Chinese artistry. Step into a <strong>2.5D Metroidvania world</strong> styled like a classic Chinese Lianhuanhua!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Gripping Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mysterious assassin, you set out to eliminate <strong>Cao Cao</strong> on the battlefield of <strong>Red Cliffs</strong>\u2014but why did you lose your memory? Travel across the land, uncover forgotten truths, and meet legendary heroes as you unveil a catastrophe that threatens the world. Will you and your allies be able to save the people from disaster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/852335644a129ad6b3f8b8493328cea3.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Vast and Beautiful World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>over ten unique locations</strong>, from peaceful villages to brutal warzones, from endless deserts to snow-covered forests. <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> showcases breathtaking landscapes inspired by China's diverse scenery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/4bda592f921a6530edab03189e8af347.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/4bda592f921a6530edab03189e8af347.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Hidden Treasures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through exploration and combat, <strong>collect rare treasures</strong> to grow stronger, unlocking <strong>previously inaccessible areas</strong>. Delve into the unknown, acquire powerful artifacts, and defeat formidable new enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/42dbf1347aef8b8afe71084f2dedc731.avif?t=1750350230\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras_big/42dbf1347aef8b8afe71084f2dedc731.avif?t=1750350230 width=800 height=370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/b1a2d4029996413f38dc74a9f54fbeff.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ffe5554ea96a2393e60c6d366a9bcf5c.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/30ff1876cbf9cf835a21f34bc3bff5fb.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Diverse Cast of Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>over 80 meticulously hand-drawn enemies</strong>, including formidable warriors, legendary beasts, and ruthless assassins. Each <strong>boss fight</strong> is uniquely designed, featuring beautifully animated enemy deaths\u2014proving that this world is full of surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/84d8fe16826860e6acb2fac36bd8715c.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/dfcba36ad3b3b15afb6d0fe6164d691e.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle in the Air and on Horseback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is not limited to walking\u2014<strong>storm enemy camps on horseback</strong> or <strong>take to the skies</strong> for intense aerial combat! These unique gameplay segments are woven into the story, ensuring an ever-fresh experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/ca78bb7f0c8525ba35e6767aeeabdb34.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/0be2f85bf2aa5a5ef0699c44bc0f6950.poster.avif?t=1750350230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/0be2f85bf2aa5a5ef0699c44bc0f6950.webm?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/extras/0be2f85bf2aa5a5ef0699c44bc0f6950.mp4?t=1750350230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Information</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Demo</strong> of <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> allows players to experience the <strong>comic book-style</strong> visuals and get a taste of this <strong>side-scrolling ARPG</strong> before its full release.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Save Function</strong> \u2013 This special prologue version does not support saving. However, players can replay the <strong>three available stages</strong> as many times as they like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language</strong> \u2013 To enhance historical immersion, the test version defaults to <strong>Traditional Clerical Script</strong> commonly used during the Three Kingdoms period.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Differences</strong> \u2013 The demo may differ from the final release.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an <strong>independent developer</strong>, I am committed to continuously refining the game. This is just the <strong>beginning, not the end</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the game, please <strong>add <i>The Righteousness: SanGuo</i> to your wishlist</strong>\u2014your support means the world to me!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thank You for Your Support!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Our Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: <strong>1016824586</strong></p>","developers":["\u7855\u72d7\u7d2f\u7d2f\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4(HarvestDog)"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927100/header.jpg?t=1750350230","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1927100/826732/51c76a79322e6203d5cf6215dcb9ec0d7ac4c88c/1751049732/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739287960","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1927100/826732/51c76a79322e6203d5cf6215dcb9ec0d7ac4c88c/1751049732/dash_h264.mpd?t=1739287960","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1927100/826732/51c76a79322e6203d5cf6